---
// MethodTimeline.astro - Proposta 1: The Technical Vertical Timeline (Ingegneristica & Sequenziale)
---

<div class="method-timeline wrap my-12 relative" aria-label="Percorso metodologico sequenziale">
    <!-- Vertical Spine Guide Line -->
    <div
        class="timeline-spine absolute left-[21px] sm:left-[27px] top-6 bottom-8 w-0.5 bg-[#0071E3]"
        aria-hidden="true"
    ></div>

    <div class="space-y-8 sm:space-y-12">
        <!-- STEP 01: ASCOLTO & ANAMNESI -->
        <div class="timeline-item relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-8 group">
            <!-- Node on the spine -->
            <div class="timeline-node relative z-10 flex h-11 w-11 sm:h-14 sm:w-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#0071E3] border-2 border-[#0071E3] font-mono text-sm sm:text-base font-black text-white ring-4 ring-white">
                01
            </div>

            <!-- Content Card -->
            <article class="timeline-card flex-1 rounded-3xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-[#F5F5F7] p-5 sm:p-8 md:p-10 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-[#0071E3] relative overflow-hidden min-w-0">

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_290px] gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-stretch">
                    <!-- Left: Narrative & Technical Points -->
                    <div class="min-w-0">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#B5CCE4] bg-[#E8F2FC] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-[#0071E3] uppercase">
                                FASE 01 · ASCOLTO & ANAMNESI
                            </span>
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#1D1D1F] tracking-tight leading-snug mb-3">
                            Partiamo da quello che <span class="text-[#0071E3]">hai osservato.</span>
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-[#6E6E73] text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            L'infiltrazione non si combatte a tentativi. Raccogliamo la cronistoria esatta del problema: da quanto tempo si manifesta, le precipitazioni concomitanti e le aree interne coinvolte. Foto e dettagli dimensionali consentono al team tecnico di tracciare la geometria dell'involucro prima dell'uscita.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Checklist punti tecnici -->
                        <div class="space-y-2.5">
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-white p-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#6E6E73]">
                                <span class="flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E8F2FC] text-[#0071E3] text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
                                <div><strong class="text-[#1D1D1F] font-semibold">Tracciamento temporale:</strong> correlazione precisa tra eventi meteo e comparsa delle macchie</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-white p-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#6E6E73]">
                                <span class="flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E8F2FC] text-[#0071E3] text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
                                <div><strong class="text-[#1D1D1F] font-semibold">Fascicolo fotografico:</strong> analisi visiva di fessure, lesioni e stato delle guaine esistenti</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-white p-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#6E6E73]">
                                <span class="flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E8F2FC] text-[#0071E3] text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
                                <div><strong class="text-[#1D1D1F] font-semibold">Classificazione tipologica:</strong> identificazione del manto (terrazzo, lastrico o fondazione)</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Right: Deliverable Card -->
                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-white p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col justify-between min-w-0">
                        <div>
                            <span class="block text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0071E3] mb-2">OUTPUT DELLA FASE</span>
                            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#1D1D1F] mb-2 leading-snug">Scheda Anagrafica Cantiere & Rilievo 24h</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-[#6E6E73] leading-relaxed">
                                Un quadro diagnostico iniziale chiaro, documentato e pronto per guidare l'ispezione sul campo senza perdite di tempo.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-[#D2D2D7] flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-[#1D1D1F]">
                                <span class="text-[#0071E3]">📋</span> Fascicolo 24h
                            </span>
                            <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-[#0071E3] font-bold">TEMPO: &lt;24H</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>

        <!-- STEP 02: VALUTAZIONE & DIAGNOSTICA IN SITU -->
        <div class="timeline-item relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-8 group">
            <!-- Node on the spine -->
            <div class="timeline-node relative z-10 flex h-11 w-11 sm:h-14 sm:w-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#0071E3] border-2 border-[#0071E3] font-mono text-sm sm:text-base font-black text-white ring-4 ring-white">
                02
            </div>

            <!-- Content Card -->
            <article class="timeline-card flex-1 rounded-3xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-[#F5F5F7] p-5 sm:p-8 md:p-10 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-[#0071E3] relative overflow-hidden min-w-0">

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_290px] gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-stretch">
                    <!-- Left: Narrative & Technical Points -->
                    <div class="min-w-0">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#B5CCE4] bg-[#E8F2FC] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-[#0071E3] uppercase">
                                FASE 02 · INDAGINE STRUMENTALE IN SITU
                            </span>
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#1D1D1F] tracking-tight leading-snug mb-3">
                            Consideriamo la superficie <span class="text-[#0071E3]">e il contesto.</span>
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-[#6E6E73] text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            L'impermeabilizzazione a regola d'arte dipende al 90% dalla preparazione del supporto. In loco non ci limitiamo a un controllo superficiale: eseguiamo indagini strumentali su umidità residua, pendenze, consistenza del massetto e tenuta delle battute perimetrali.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Checklist punti tecnici -->
                        <div class="space-y-2.5">
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-white p-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#6E6E73]">
                                <span class="flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E8F2FC] text-[#0071E3] text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
                                <div><strong class="text-[#1D1D1F] font-semibold">Diagnosi termo-igrometrica:</strong> misurazione dell'umidità interna al massetto per prevenire delaminazioni</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-white p-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#6E6E73]">
                                <span class="flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E8F2FC] text-[#0071E3] text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
                                <div><strong class="text-[#1D1D1F] font-semibold">Verifica punti singolari:</strong> bocchettoni pluviali, giunti strutturali e risvolti verticali</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-white p-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#6E6E73]">
                                <span class="flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E8F2FC] text-[#0071E3] text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
                                <div><strong class="text-[#1D1D1F] font-semibold">Test di adesione pull-off:</strong> selezione mirata del primer epossidico o poliuretanico bicomponente</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Right: Deliverable Card -->
                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-white p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col justify-between min-w-0">
                        <div>
                            <span class="block text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0071E3] mb-2">OUTPUT DELLA FASE</span>
                            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#1D1D1F] mb-2 leading-snug">Relazione Termo-Igrometrica & Supporto</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-[#6E6E73] leading-relaxed">
                                Certificazione strumentale dell'idoneità del sottofondo e piano di trattamento preventivo per azzerare ogni rischio di distacco.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-[#D2D2D7] flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-[#1D1D1F]">
                                <span class="text-[#0071E3]">🔬</span> Mappatura In Situ
                            </span>
                            <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-[#0071E3] font-bold">TEST IN SITU</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>

        <!-- STEP 03: PROPOSTA & CAPITOLATO CERTIFICATO -->
        <div class="timeline-item relative flex items-start gap-4 sm:gap-8 group">
            <!-- Node on the spine -->
            <div class="timeline-node relative z-10 flex h-11 w-11 sm:h-14 sm:w-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#30A14E] border-2 border-[#30A14E] font-mono text-sm sm:text-base font-black text-white ring-4 ring-white">
                03
            </div>

            <!-- Content Card -->
            <article class="timeline-card flex-1 rounded-3xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-[#F5F5F7] p-5 sm:p-8 md:p-10 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-[#30A14E] relative overflow-hidden min-w-0">

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_290px] gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-stretch">
                    <!-- Left: Narrative & Technical Points -->
                    <div class="min-w-0">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-[#B7E4C2] bg-[#E9F7EC] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-[#1F7A38] uppercase">
                                FASE 03 · SOLUZIONE CONTINUA & GARANZIA
                            </span>
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#1D1D1F] tracking-tight leading-snug mb-3">
                            Condividiamo i passi successivi e <span class="text-[#1F7A38]">il piano d'opera.</span>
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-[#6E6E73] text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Ricevi un piano chiaro con computo metrico dettagliato e costi bloccati. Intervento a caldo con elastomero di poliurea pura: applicazione rapida, membrana monolitica continua senza giunzioni né saldature, calpestabile dopo soli 60 minuti.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Checklist punti tecnici -->
                        <div class="space-y-2.5">
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-white p-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#6E6E73]">
                                <span class="flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E9F7EC] text-[#1F7A38] text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
                                <div><strong class="text-[#1D1D1F] font-semibold">Membrana continua ad alta pressione:</strong> 2.2 mm di poliurea pura applicata a 70°C e 200 bar</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-white p-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#6E6E73]">
                                <span class="flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E9F7EC] text-[#1F7A38] text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
                                <div><strong class="text-[#1D1D1F] font-semibold">Certificazione ETAG 005 - W3:</strong> massimo standard europeo per durabilità attesa di 25 anni</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-white p-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#6E6E73]">
                                <span class="flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#E9F7EC] text-[#1F7A38] text-xs font-bold mt-0.5">✓</span>
                                <div><strong class="text-[#1D1D1F] font-semibold">Zero demolizioni:</strong> -40% sui costi totali, nessun carico strutturale aggiuntivo e zero macerie</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Right: Deliverable Card -->
                    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#D2D2D7] bg-white p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col justify-between min-w-0">
                        <div>
                            <span class="block text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#1F7A38] mb-2">OUTPUT DELLA FASE</span>
                            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-[#1D1D1F] mb-2 leading-snug">Capitolato Prestazionale & Garanzia Decennale</h3>
                            <p class="text-xs text-[#6E6E73] leading-relaxed">
                                Documento contrattuale con computo metrico estimativo, cronoprogramma esecutivo e garanzia decennale diretta.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-[#D2D2D7] flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-[#1D1D1F]">
                                <span class="text-[#1F7A38]">📑</span> Fascicolo Esecutivo
                            </span>
                            <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-[#1F7A38] font-bold">GARANZIA 10 ANNI</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
